    "scope": "291 detector tests, strict Clippy/docs and six complete outputs pass. Alamofire default elapsed -0.27% and groups 356.3 to347.8ms; libGDX elapsed +2.50%; other effects small and mixed. Initial variant also lacked benefit. Three-block screens without same-binary controls do not qualify release. Neither prepared memory producer was run; no RSS claims. Preserve the numerical oracles and source patches, remove both isolated product changes."
